import{createIdGuard}from"../utils";import{state}from"./store";const trackedGuard=createIdGuard("scTrackedUpsells");export const dispatchUpsellAccepted=(t,e)=>{if(!(null==e?void 0:e.id))return;if(trackedGuard.has(e.id))return;trackedGuard.add(e.id);const d=new CustomEvent("scUpsellAccepted",{detail:{checkout:t,line_item:e,upsell:state.upsell,product:state.product},bubbles:!0});document.dispatchEvent(d)};